+## Version 8.5.1
+
+Unreleased
+
+- A `default_map` keyed by subcommand name now supplies defaults to that
+  subcommand. Previously the parent's whole map was passed down, so
+  subcommand defaults were ignored.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
